from last year because sales in abroad impacted to sales of TV Home Shopping&#xD;
market of Korea as it operates in 12 other countries including China, Thailand,&#xD;
India, Indonesia, Vietnam and Taiwan. The operations such as CJ Oshopping, GS&#xD;
home shopping , lotte home shopping, Hyundai home shopping in China, CJ&#xD;
Oshopping, GS home shopping , lotte home shopping in Thailand, CJ Oshopping,&#xD;
GS home shopping in India, GS home shopping in Indonesia, CJ Oshopping, GS&#xD;
home shopping , lotte home shopping, and Hyundai home shopping in Vietnam&#xD;
